---
/**
 * Home page card grid for the splash hero.
 *
 * Re-uses the Carbon-style line icons from the original mkdocs site
 * (docs/overrides/.icons/cldk). Each icon is inlined as a single SVG whose
 * paths inherit `currentColor`, so the accent color is driven entirely by CSS,
 * matching the "MCP restraint on Carbon" theme in docs.css. Cards lift with a
 * soft drop shadow on hover.
 */

